dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.kit.diff
version 1
schema s.stdio.semio.kit
start body
framing record

# UNIFIED-COMPOSABLE-ARTIFACT-SYSTEM kit wave (W2c). Real binary diff frame: `format u8` +
# `presence u8` (bit0=types, bit1=designs, bit2=objects, bit3=models, bit4=properties,
# bit5=representations) are two REAL fixed fields; the present fields' own encodings follow as one
# opaque trailing `payload` chain — the real Rust `encode_diff`/`decode_diff`
# (`../../🦀️component.rs`) stays genuinely structured.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field presence u8

chain payload bytes
